#: core/Utils/Util.vala:606
msgid "On This Computer"
msgstr "Na tem računalniku"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:631
msgid "Meet Planify"
msgstr "Spoznaj Planify"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:634
msgid ""
"This project shows you everything you need to know to hit the ground "
"running. Don’t hesitate to play around with it – you can always recreate it "
"from Preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ta projekt vam pokaže vse, kar morate vedeti, da se takoj lotite dela. Brez "
"oklevanja se poigrajte z njim – vedno ga lahko poustvarite v nastavitvah."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:641
msgid "Tap this task"
msgstr "Dotaknite se te naloge"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:642
msgid ""
"You're looking at a to-do! Complete it by tapping the checkbox on the left. "
msgstr ""
"To je opravilo! Dokončajte ga tako, da kliknete na potrditveno polje na "
"levi. "

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:647
msgid "Create a new task"
msgstr "Ustvari novo nalogo"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:648
msgid ""
"Now it's your turn! Tap the '+' button at the bottom of your project, enter "
"a task description, and tap the 'Add Task' button."
msgstr ""
"Zdaj ste na vrsti vi! Dotaknite se gumba »+« na dnu projekta, vnesite opis "
"naloge in kliknite na gumb »Dodaj nalogo«."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:653
msgid "Plan this to-do for today or later"
msgstr "Načrtujte to opravilo za danes ali pozneje"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:654
msgid ""
"Tap the calendar button at the bottom to decide when to complete this to-do."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na gumb koledarja na dnu in izberite, kdaj želite dokončati to "
"opravilo."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:659
msgid "Reorder your to-dos"
msgstr "Spremenite vrstni red opravil"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:660
msgid ""
"To reorder your list, tap and hold a to-do, then drag it to where it should "
"go."
msgstr ""
"Če želite spremeniti vrstni red seznama, kliknite in pridržite opravilo ter "
"jo povlecite na želeno mesto."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:665
msgid "Create a project"
msgstr "Ustvari projekt"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:666
msgid ""
"Organize your to-dos better! Go to the left panel and click the '+' button "
"in the 'On This Computer' section and add a project of your own."
msgstr ""
"Bolje organizirajte svoja opravila! Na levi plošči v razdelku »Na tem "
"računalniku« kliknite gumb »+« in dodajte svoj projekt."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:671
msgid "You’re done!"
msgstr "Končali ste!"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:672
msgid ""
"That’s all you really need to know. Feel free to start adding your own "
"projects and to-dos.\n"
"You can come back to this project later to learn the advanced features "
"below.\n"
"We hope you’ll enjoy using Planify!"
msgstr ""
"To je vse, kar morate vedeti. Začnite dodajati svoje projekte in opravila.\n"
"K temu projektu se lahko vrnete pozneje, da se seznanite s spodnjimi "
"naprednimi funkcijami.\n"
"Upamo, da boste uživali v uporabi programa Planify!"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:686
msgid "Tune your setup"
msgstr "Prilagodite nastavitve"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:694
msgid "Show your calendar events"
msgstr "Prikaži dogodke v koledarju"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:695
msgid ""
"You can display your system's calendar events in Planify. Go to "
"'Preferences' 🡒 General 🡒 Calendar Events to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"V programu Planify si lahko ogledate dogodke v koledarju sistema. Za vklop "
"pojdite na »Nastavitve« 🡒 Splošno 🡒 Dogodki v koledarju."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:701
msgid "Enable synchronization with third-party services"
msgstr "Omogočite sinhronizacijo s storitvami tretjih oseb"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:702
msgid ""
"Planify not only creates tasks locally, but can also synchronize with your "
"Todoist account. Go to 'Preferences' 🡒 'Accounts'."
msgstr ""
"Planify omogoča ustvarjanje nalog lokalno in sinhronizacijo z vašim računom "
"Todoist. Pojdite na »Nastavitve« 🡒 »Računi«."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:710
msgid "Boost your productivity"
msgstr "Povečajte svojo produktivnost"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:718
msgid "Drag the plus button!"
msgstr "Povlecite gumb plus!"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:719
msgid ""
"That blue button you see at the bottom of each screen is more powerful than "
"it looks: it's made to move! Drag it up to create a task wherever you want."
msgstr ""
"Tisti modri gumb, ki ga vidite na dnu vsakega zaslona, je močnejši, kot je "
"videti: narejen je za premikanje! Povlecite ga navzgor, da ustvarite nalogo, "
"kjer koli želite."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:725
msgid "Add labels to your tasks!"
msgstr "Dodajte oznake svojim nalogam!"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:726
msgid ""
"Labels help you organize and categorize your tasks. To add a label, click "
"the label button at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Oznake vam pomagajo organizirati in razvrščati naloge. Če želite dodati "
"oznako, kliknite gumb za oznako na dnu."

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:732
msgid "Set timely reminders!"
msgstr "Nastavite pravočasne opomnike!"

#: core/Utils/Util.vala:733
msgid ""
"Get notified about important tasks or events. Tap the clock button below to "
"add a reminder."
msgstr ""
"Prejemajte obvestila o pomembnih nalogah ali dogodkih. Kliknite na spodnji "
"gumb z uro, da dodate opomnik."

